# Secrets: Wi-Fi SSID/password and ThingSpeak write key. Copy app_secrets.h.template.
Core/Inc/app_secrets.h
# Host-side ThingSpeak values (channel ID, read key) for checking uploads. Copy the .template.
tools/thingspeak_host.env

# Build output (one folder per build configuration)
Debug/
Release/
Debug-Trace/
build/

# Compiled files
*.elf
*.hex
*.bin
*.map
*.list
*.o
*.su
*.d
*.cyclo

# STM32CubeIDE: launch files and per-machine state, recreated on import -- except the two shared
# Debug-Trace launch configurations (docs/06-tracing.md, 6.3)
*.launch
!/Debug-Trace (flash and debug).launch
!/Debug-Trace (attach, dump).launch
.settings/language.settings.xml
.metadata/

# STM32CubeMX backup of the .ioc
*.ioc.bak

# Trace captures (raw ring dumps; decoded results that belong in the docs go to docs/results/)
ring.bin
trace_out/

# Editors and OS (swap/backup files can hold secrets, e.g. Core/Inc/.app_secrets.h.swp)
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.#*
.vscode/
.cache/
.clangd
compile_commands.json
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
